---
import Township from '../layouts/Township.astro';
---
<Township title="Fire & EMS" description="Fernhollow Township Fire and EMS: emergencies, burn permits and station information.">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>Fire &amp; EMS</h1>
    <p><strong>In an emergency, call 911.</strong> Do not use the website or email to report an emergency.</p>
    <h2>Burn permits</h2>
    <p>Open burning of yard waste needs a permit from the fire department. Call the station before you burn. No permits are issued on high-wind or dry-weather days.</p>
    <h2>Smoke alarm help</h2>
    <p>Residents can ask the department to check or install smoke alarms. Call the non-emergency line to schedule a visit.</p>
    <h2>Station</h2>
    <p>Station 1<br />40 Station Road, Fernhollow<br />Non-emergency line: (555) 010-0150</p>
    <h2>Join the department</h2>
    <p>The department welcomes volunteers. Training is provided. <a href="/contact">Contact the township office</a> to get started.</p>
  </div>
</Township>
